WEBVTT

00:10:25.746 --> 00:10:30.125
And then they started adding in
Japanese flavors like soy sauce,

00:10:30.167 --> 00:10:32.086
wasabi, green tea.

00:10:32.628 --> 00:10:37.257
And then it became a Japanese biscuit
and a Japanese souvenir

00:10:37.257 --> 00:10:40.260
and then was sold back into Britain,

00:10:40.260 --> 00:10:43.681
where today you can buy
green tea Kit Kats.

00:10:43.722 --> 00:10:45.099
(Laughter)

00:10:45.140 --> 00:10:47.393
And they're actually made in Germany.

00:10:47.434 --> 00:10:49.353
(Laughter)

00:10:49.353 --> 00:10:53.148
So today a Kit Kat is British and Swiss,

00:10:53.190 --> 00:10:54.900
because Nestlé owns it,

00:10:54.942 --> 00:10:57.111
and Japanese and German.

00:10:57.486 --> 00:10:58.987
Culture is a river.

00:10:59.029 --> 00:11:03.367
It changes. New streams come in,
and that is fantastic.